var ENT=[["dbt", "SQL transformations with tests and docs."], ["Apache Spark", "Distributed DataFrame transformations."], ["Frictionless Data", "Table Schema specs for tabular data."], ["Miller", "Like awk and sed for CSV and JSON."], ["Trifacta", "Visual wrangling suggesting transforms."], ["Talend", "Open-source data integration studio."], ["Pentaho Kettle", "ETL with a visual designer."]];
